I walk out of the sports hall.
The evening air outside is cool.
I go to my bicycle.
I get on my bicycle and ride off.
I gladly ride through the city in the evening.
The streets are quiet now.
My legs are very tired.
But I am really cheerful.
I already know three friendly people at the club.
Timo, Lena, and Max are nice.
We want to play together again next Thursday.
I can play badminton every Thursday now.
On Tuesday I go to the gym.
And on Thursday I am at the sports club.
That is a great plan.
I ride on to my flat.
Soon I am at home.
I smile.
